# Per-run timestamped config dumps written to the repo root by `manager`
# (YYMMDD_HH-MM-SS.yaml). One per run, so a 20-run batch leaves 20 behind.
/2[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]_[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].yaml

